	//	On the one hand, the page
	//		https://www.gymglish.com/en/frantastique/french-grammar/de-vs-depuis
	//	implies that using "depuis" with this meaning is proscribed.
	//	On the other hand, the page
	//		https://forum.wordreference.com/threads/fr-de-depuis-à-partir-de-lieu-ou-moment.774134/
	//	says that, in spite of the rules of the Académie française, "depuis" is
	//	very much used with this meaning to resolve potential ambiguities like
	//		"prendre une photo de la montagne" = "prendere una foto della montagna"
	//	vs. "prendre une photo de la montagne" = "prendere una foto dalla montagna"
